    "detailed_description": "<h1>Our best games</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057630/extras/aca82b3532e8699d1fac41cd1bf097ec.poster.avif?t=1716961737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057630/extras/aca82b3532e8699d1fac41cd1bf097ec.webm?t=1716961737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057630/extras/aca82b3532e8699d1fac41cd1bf097ec.mp4?t=1716961737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Starving for some challenge? Starting with just a few dollars in your pocket, conquer the world of gastronomy! Become a famous guru who helps failing restaurants rise from their knees.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057630/extras/41366e2ef4ce9a751d57ac435f9d91ff.poster.avif?t=1716961737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057630/extras/41366e2ef4ce9a751d57ac435f9d91ff.webm?t=1716961737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Show your imagination but also get  tools you need to make the restaurant of your dreams. You have to be a tough cookie to face up this challenge!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057630/extras/42f5014499b53bf4f80f664f8009dff2.poster.avif?t=1716961737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057630/extras/42f5014499b53bf4f80f664f8009dff2.webm?t=1716961737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Invest in your business and let your Renovator's empire grow. Every good review will influence your prestige and bring you closer to becoming the best Restaurant Renovator in town!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057630/extras/cbc25b676b62d33842cac4f778fc28e7.poster.avif?t=1716961737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057630/extras/cbc25b676b62d33842cac4f778fc28e7.webm?t=1716961737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
